/*
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    UIHousingPlot.uss
    Housing Plot Panel  —  Structure & Layout only
    Unity UIToolkit  (Unity 6.x LTS)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    NO colors or fonts here — those live in FishMMO-Theme.uss.
    Sized against the 1200x800 reference resolution declared by
    Assets/UI Toolkit/PanelSettings.asset (matched on width, so a
    16:9 window is 675 units tall: the panel stays well under it).
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
*/

.plot-panel {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 50%; translate: -50% -50%;
    width: 440px;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-header {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 44px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    padding-right: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-header__title {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
}

.plot-body {
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    height: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-row__key {
    width: 90px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
}

.plot-row__value {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    -unity-text-align: middle-left;
}

/* Wrapping lines: the rent standing and the server's last answer. */
.plot-status,
.plot-message {
    margin-top: 8px;
    white-space: normal;
    -unity-text-align: upper-left;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-footer {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    height: 44px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    padding-right: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-footer__button {
    margin-left: 8px;
    min-width: 72px;
    height: 28px;
}

/* ── Pay ahead ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.plot-prepay {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 8px;
    height: 28px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-prepay__step {
    width: 28px;
    min-width: 28px;
    height: 26px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-prepay__periods {
    width: 80px;
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-prepay__pay {
    flex: 1;
    height: 26px;
    margin-left: 8px;
}

/* ── Guests ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.plot-guests {
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-top: 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guests__title {
    height: 20px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guests__add {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* Not pinned to a height (see fishmmo-uitk-conventions): the theme's padding needs room to draw the text. */
.plot-guests__name {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 22px;
}

.plot-guests__grant {
    margin-left: 8px;
    min-width: 80px;
    height: 26px;
}

.plot-guests__flags {
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guests__flag {
    margin-right: 10px;
}

.plot-guests__list {
    max-height: 150px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guest-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    height: 26px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guest-row__name {
    width: 130px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guest-row__flags {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.plot-guest-row__revoke {
    min-width: 64px;
    height: 22px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-guests__empty {
    margin-top: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.plot-hidden {
    display: none;
}
